<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>四季养生 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%9B%9B%E5%AD%A3%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.158.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.3</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 21 Mar 2026 05:41:43 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%9B%9B%E5%AD%A3%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>生气通天论篇第三</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-03/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jan 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-03/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>生命源自天地之气，人体的气与天地相通，五脏六腑、经脉相互协调。顺应天地法则、调和精神与阴阳，能保持健康与长寿；反之，生活不规律、情志不稳，阳气失调，则易生病。保持阴阳平衡，避免过度饮食、劳累和不良环境，是防病保健的关键。</description></item><item><title>四气调神大论篇第二</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-02/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jan 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-02/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>详细描述了四季养生的原则，强调人应顺应自然界的变化，通过调整作息、饮食和情志来保持健康。春季应晚睡早起，保持心境平和，避免肝气过旺；夏季则应尽量避免烦躁，保持情绪平稳，以防心脏受损；秋季要保持安静，避免过度活动，以保肺气；冬季则需早睡晚起，避免过度运动，保护肾精。若违背这些养生法则，将导致身体各脏腑受损，进而引发疾病，影响寿命。顺应天地阴阳变化是生命的根本，违背自然法则则会导致健康问题，强调“治未病”的重要性，提倡在病未发生时就进行预防，以保持长寿和健康。</description></item></channel></rss>